  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nGiven : 23 × 7 − 76 + 87 ÷ 344 = 2\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers:\n\nOption - (1): × and ÷\n\n23 × 7 − 76 + 87 ÷ 344 = 2 ⇒ 23 ÷ 7 − 76 + 87 × 344 = 2\n\n⇒ __**23 ÷**____** 7**__ − 76 + 87 × 344 = 2\n\n⇒ 3.28 − 76 + __**87 **____**×**____** 344**__ = 2\n\n⇒ __**3.28 + 29928**__ − 76 = 2\n\n⇒ __29931.28____** − 76**__ = 2\n\n⇒ 29855.28 ≠ 2 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption - (2): ÷ and =\n\n23 × 7 − 76 + 87 ÷ 344 = 2 ⇒ 23 × 7 − 76 + 87 = 344 ÷ 2\n\n⇒ __**23 × 7**__ − 76 + 87 = __**344 **____**÷ 2**__\n\n⇒ __**161 + 87**__ − 76 = 172\n\n⇒ __**248 − 76**__ = 172\n\n**⇒ 172 = 172 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption - (3): × and −\n\n23 × 7 − 76 + 87 ÷ 344 = 2 ⇒ 23 - 7 × 76 + 87 ÷ 344 = 2\n\n⇒ 23 - 7 × 76 + __**87 ÷ 344**__ = 2\n\n⇒ 23 - __**7 **____**×**____** 76**__ + 0.25 = 2\n\n⇒ __**23 + 0.25**__ - 532 = 2\n\n⇒ __23.25____** - 532**__ = 2\n\n⇒ -508.75 ≠ 2 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption - (4): + and × \n\n23 × 7 − 76 + 87 ÷ 344 = 2 ⇒ 23 + 7 − 76 × 87 ÷ 344 = 2\n\n⇒ 23 + 7 − 76 × __**87 ÷ 344**__ = 2\n\n⇒ 23 + 7 − __**76 **____**×**____** 0.25**__ = 2\n\n⇒ __**23 + 7**__ − 19 = 2\n\n⇒ 30 − 19 = 2\n\n⇒ 11 ≠ 2 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
